# The witness's own warehouse credential. It is the witness's, not the host's:
# accounts must hold no warehouse writer capability at all, or a compromise of
# the database could rewrite the evidence that database's narrowings are
# witnessed by.
#
# Optional, together with POLICY_LOG_WAREHOUSE_ENDPOINT: both set configures the
# warehouse mirror, neither runs the witness with no mirror (stated at boot), and
# one without the other is refused. Empty here, because this local composition
# configures no mirror. Where one is configured, it is a unique, high-entropy
# token delivered through Codefly's secret configuration provider.
POLICY_LOG_WAREHOUSE_TOKEN=

# Persistent witness identity, provisioned by the composition secret provider.
# Canonical standard base64 of PKCS#8 Ed25519 DER; no generated boot fallback.
POLICY_LOG_SIGNING_KEY=local-dev-only-replace-me
